   = help: the following other types implement trait `From<T>`:
             `serde_json::value::Value` implements `From<&[T]>`
             `serde_json::value::Value` implements `From<&str>`
             `serde_json::value::Value` implements `From<()>`
             `serde_json::value::Value` implements `From<Cow<'_, str>>`
             `serde_json::value::Value` implements `From<Option<T>>`
             `serde_json::value::Value` implements `From<String>`
             `serde_json::value::Value` implements `From<Vec<T>>`
             `serde_json::value::Value` implements `From<[T; N]>`
           and $N others
   = note: required for `CapturedUsage` to implement `Into<serde_json::value::Value>`
